A lazy-created bank answers 404 {"detail":"Bank '<id>' not found"} on
every bank-scoped route until the first seed; stock 0.6.1 treated any 404 as
'knowledge pages unsupported' and latched knowledgePagesSupported=false for
the process lifetime.

- tree(): 404+bank-missing → empty tree (capability intact); tolerate 405/501
  via req() instead of blanket-latching 404
- getPage(): 404+bank-missing → explicit 'bank does not exist yet' error
- seedPages POST/PATCH: 404+bank-missing → defer with log, keep capability

Ported from the in-place dist patch (dsh-config profiles/web/patches).
Verified: rebuilt dist/dsh.js byte-identical to the live patched dist modulo
one stripped JSDoc comment; vitest 1017/1017.
---
